      "refersTo": "benchmark-tabs",
      "description": "Scrollable tab labels with a thin blue active rule.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Quick benchmark suites\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">DeepSWE</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Terminal-Bench</button><button class=\"ds-tab ds-tab-selected\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">FrontierCode</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:stretch;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);gap:27px;overflow-x:auto;height:50px;scrollbar-width:none}.ds-tab{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;flex-shrink:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:0 13px;font-size:17px;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;line-height:48px;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--blue);font-weight:650;border-bottom-color:var(--blue)}.ds-tab:hover{background:#e0edf9}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Model choice",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "model-choice",
      "description": "Persistent shortlist checkbox with model identity and an explicit missing-evidence reason.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-model\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span><span>Sonnet 5.5</span></label><label class=\"ds-model ds-unavailable\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled><span class=\"ds-dot ds-legacy\"></span><span>Fable 5<small>No published result in this suite</small></span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-model{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;min-height:39px;height:auto;padding:3px 0;line-height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px;white-space:normal;color:var(--ink)}.ds-checkbox{appearance:auto;width:18px;height:18px;margin:0 8px 0 1px;accent-color:var(--blue);flex-shrink:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-checkbox:disabled{cursor:default}.ds-checkbox:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}.ds-dot{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--blue)}.ds-model small{display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:15px;color:var(--secondary)}.ds-unavailable{cursor:default;color:var(--secondary)}.ds-unavailable .ds-dot{opacity:.45}.ds-legacy{background:#6d568d}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Research plate",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "plate",
      "description": "Recurring flat research container for coverage and inspected evidence.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-plate\"><h2 class=\"ds-plate-title\">Published evidence</h2><p class=\"ds-plate-copy\">Published evidence retains source-specific conditions.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-plate{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-radius:4px;padding:19px 18px 20px}.ds-plate-title{margin:0;font-size:23px;line-height:29px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.015em}.ds-plate-copy{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;max-width:75ch}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Result table",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "result-table",
      "description": "Source-aware ledger of every selected effort, with row inspection and tabular values.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-table-scroll\"><table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Model</th><th scope=\"col\">Effort</th><th scope=\"col\">Score</th><th scope=\"col\">Published cost</th><th scope=\"col\">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\"><button class=\"ds-result\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-result-dot\"></span>Sonnet 5.5</button></th><td>xhigh</td><td>52.1%</td><td>$1.59</td><td>Anthropic</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
      "css": ".ds-table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}.ds-table{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:15px;table-layout:fixed;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ink)}.ds-table thead{background:#f3f8fd}.ds-table th,.ds-table td{height:30px;padding:2px 16px;border:1px solid var(--rule);line-height:23px}.ds-table thead th{font-weight:650;font-size:14px}.ds-table tbody th{font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}.ds-table tbody td:nth-child(2){color:var(--secondary)}.ds-result{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-align:left;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;max-width:100%;white-space:normal;cursor:pointer}.ds-result:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-result:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}.ds-result-dot{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue);margin-right:12px;flex-shrink:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile estimate ledger",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Readable model, per-call and monthly estimates above the horizontally scrollable rate table on mobile.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-estimates\"><h3>Your scenario estimates</h3><div class=\"ds-estimate-row\"><h4>Claude Sonnet 5.5</h4><dl><div><dt>Per API call</dt><dd>$0.04</dd></div><div><dt>Per month</dt><dd>$4</dd></div></dl></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-estimates{font-family:'Geist',sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.ds-estimates>h3{font-size:17px;line-height:24px;font-weight:650;margin:0;padding:0 0 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.ds-estimate-row{padding:13px 0 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.ds-estimate-row h4{font-size:14px;line-height:21px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-estimate-row dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;margin:0}.ds-estimate-row dt{color:var(--secondary);font-size:11px;line-height:17px}.ds-estimate-row dd{font-size:17px;line-height:25px;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:2px 0 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Scientific research plate",
    "overview": "The system feels professional, premium and precise. Cool flat paper supports navy typography, fine rules and a near-white reading field. Quality comes from alignment, clear hierarchy and inspectable evidence. There is no physical texture in this world.\n\nGeist keeps interface labels, prose and data in one voice. Compact controls and dense tables coexist with an open chart field. Source conditions and exact values remain readable parts of the interface; missing cost is represented without an invented value. The surface-specific composition and its approved mock belong in [the benchmark explorer brief](.impeccable/surfaces/index-html.md).",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool flat paper and near-white figure plates.",
      "Navy ink, blue interaction states and labelled model colors.",
      "Compact Geist hierarchy with tabular table numbers.",
      "Thin rules, small corners and native controls.",
      "First-exposure chart drawing with reduced-motion support.",
      "Near-marker dark tooltips show exact model, effort, score and published cost on pointer hover or keyboard focus; their measured bounds stay inside the responsive chart."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** retain cool flat surfaces, navy reading text and thin table/grid rules.",
      "**Do** pair model colors with readable labels and inspection states.",
      "**Do** reuse Geist and tabular numerals in data tables.",
      "**Do** wrap controls and scroll wide tables while preserving readable mobile text.",
      "**Do** keep visible keyboard focus, native input affordances and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce physical texture, lifted cards or hard offset shadows into this flat scientific world.",
      "**Don't** use color alone to communicate model identity or missing evidence.",
      "**Don't** connect unlike sources or conditions into a single visual data series.",
      "**Don't** scale the entire desktop figure down to fit a mobile viewport."
    ]
  }
}
